      "title": "Recode Studios Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Recode Studios Limited announced that the Board of Directors of the company, at their Meeting held on May 30, 2026, the Board of Directors has recommended a Final Dividend of INR 0.25 per equity share of face value of INR 10 each on 10,644,344 fully paid-up equity shares, aggregating to 2.661 million (approximately), for the financial year ended March 31, 2026. The payment of dividend is subject to the approval of the shareholders at the upcoming Annual General Meeting (AGM) of the Company.",
